@startuml detection_lifecycle
title Detection Engineering Lifecycle

skinparam backgroundColor #FAFAFA
skinparam roundcorner 10
skinparam stateBackgroundColor LightBlue
skinparam stateBorderColor DarkBlue

[*] --> Draft : Rule authored

state Draft {
  note : Schema validated\nATT&CK mapped\nOwner assigned
}

Draft --> ShadowValidation : Submit for validation

state ShadowValidation {
  note : Replay against historical events\nFP/FN rate measured\nEvidence linkage checked
}

ShadowValidation --> ShadowActive : Validation PASS
ShadowValidation --> Draft : Validation FAIL — return to author

state ShadowActive {
  note : Rule runs in shadow pipeline\nNo active alerts produced\nPerformance monitored
}

ShadowActive --> SoakCandidate : 6h soak scheduled

state SoakCandidate {
  note : Domain-specific 6h soak\nfallback_count = 0\nfailure_count = 0\nduplicate_rate = 0\np95_latency_ms < 300
}

SoakCandidate --> StagedActive : Soak PASS + ACTIVE_ALLOWLIST entry
SoakCandidate --> ShadowActive : Soak FAIL — remain shadow

state StagedActive {
  note : Rule produces active alerts\nalert-writer-service consumes\nFP/FN tracking continues
}

StagedActive --> Suppression : Analyst recommends suppression
Suppression --> StagedActive : Suppression approved + active

StagedActive --> Deprecated : Rule retired

Deprecated --> [*]

note right of SoakCandidate
  ACTIVE_ALLOWLIST in xdr_rule_registry_validate.py
  Currently intentionally EMPTY for all shadow domains
  Requires explicit domain-specific soak evidence
end note

note right of Suppression
  Suppression advisory only
  No autonomous suppression
  Analyst explicit approval required
end note

@enduml
